	)
	(text "REWORK / DFT OPTIONS ON THIS SHEET\n  R200-R203  0R   per-anchor +3V3 link: current measurement, isolate a dead anchor.\n  R204-R207  0R   CS links.   R208-R211 0R IRQ links.   R212-R215 0R RSTn links.\n  R216-R219  DNP  SYNC links (fit to enable OSTR on chosen anchors).\n  C200-C207  DNP  pi-match shunts; R220-R223 0R pi-match series.\n  Y1, C208, C209 DNP  A0-only fallback crystal (TXC 8Y38472012, DS Fig 32\n                   X1 / Table 22). Remove C24 + C28 and fit these: A0 then\n                   ranges on its own crystal while the shared clock is\n                   debugged. TDoA is meaningless in that state.\n  TP500-TP527 test pads: per anchor +3V3_An, EXTON, GPIO0-GPIO4.\n     GPIO2/RXLED, GPIO3/TXLED, GPIO0/RXOKLED, GPIO1/SFDLED can be configured\n     as LED-style strobes: scope them across anchors to see RX/TX timing.\n     (Do not hang LEDs on them -- DS Table 2 note 2.)\n  TP refs TP500+ are outside the agent block table: renumber at merge if\n  the coordinator prefers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 325.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dc53462d-c7d5-4cf3-b02a-074860fac7dd")
	)
